<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=Cp1252">
    <meta name="generator" content="Helen">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../../../../javahelp.css">
    <title>Opening specific window or element help window</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" s7starttagpos="302" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp; Opening specific window or
      element help window
    </h1>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="7" cellspacing="0" bordercolor="#000000" width="490">
      <col width="229">
      <col width="231">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="474">
          <p align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Use case: Opening specific window or element help window</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="474">
          <p align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Actor: User</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Normal course</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Alternative courses</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.The user presses F1 key on a program window or inside an item of a
            dialogue.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.If the item or the window have defined the property of online help,
            the help window is opened in the position of the required assistance.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.1.If the item or the window have not&nbsp;defined the property of
            online help, any window is opened.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <p>
       &nbsp;
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
